Project: Eigen, template library for linear algebra: matrices, vectors, numerical solvers, and related algorithms
URL: http://eigen.tuxfamily.org/index.php?title=Main_Page
License: MPL2
Upstream version: 3.4.0
Local modifications: none

Updated 2026-04-03 to fix GCC 15 linker errors (undefined references to
Eigen template instantiations in libmv/ceres). Eigen 3.3.7 was from 2019
and predates GCC 15's stricter inline/template handling.

Source: https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen/-/releases/3.4.0
